  "risks_watch": [
   "Structured products concentration on Anand Rathi Global Finance (related party), with heavy reliance on MTM gains in other income (INR96 crore in Q1).",
   "Growth target of 20-25% AUM CAGR depends on sustained net sales of INR1,100-1,200 crore per month and markets delivering 10-12% MTM; Q1 saw market volatility.",
   "Possible AMC yield compression from TER changes and distributor bargaining, though management sizes it as 1-3 bps.",
   "Key-person dependence on Joint CEO and senior RMs; three RMs left for a competitor in the prior quarter.",
   "Regulatory: RBI bank guarantee circular on capital market entities and its effect on derivatives business at the NBFC; watch for exchange volume impact."
  ],
  "management_tone": "Confident and expansive on long-term growth and client metrics, with repeated reiteration of guidance; notably evasive on specifics for the AMC launch, UK business economics and the NBFC revaluation, deferring detail to future disclosures.",
